  "scaleNote": "This is a 250 m Terra MODIS NDVI point sample in central Bohol, averaged from good- or marginal-reliability 16-day observations by month. It is a regional landscape sample, not a verified ube field or crop-yield measurement. Bohol reporting documents yam cultivation and the Ubi Kinampay tradition at province scale; the sampled pixel's crop is not identified. NDVI measures vegetation greenness, not yam yield, harvested tubers, or damage. National production statistics are a separate measure and cannot be inferred from this point sample.",
